# World Clock & Weather: environment variables
#
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY is read on the server only: by api/weather.ts (the
# Vercel function) and by the Vite dev and preview servers. Do not give it a
# VITE_ prefix: Vite copies VITE_ variables into the public JavaScript bundle.
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://openweathermap.org/api
# 2. Copy your API key from the OpenWeather dashboard
# 3. Local: copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below
# 4. Vercel: Project Settings > Environment Variables > OPENWEATHER_API_KEY
#
# The placeholder counts as "not set": the cards then show a setup hint.
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
